OL,4,CSouth Korea education minister resigns 
OL,5,Cover exam cheating scandal             
OL,6,GSouth Korea's Education Minister Choi  
OL,7,GKyo-jin has resigned over an exam      
OL,8,Gcheating scandal that shocked the      
OL,9,Gnation.                                
OL,11,FHe said he took full responsibility    
OL,12,Ffor the confusion caused by last-      
OL,13,Fminute measures aimed at stopping AI-  
OL,14,Fassisted cheating during Thursday's    
OL,15,Fannual college entrance exam, known as 
OL,16,FSuneung.                               
